WEBVTT

00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:20,460
Should I be concerned about the amount of EMFs in the bedroom if the right, the generator and the laptop are all on all night.

00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:25,460
Currently, I don't even leave my router turned on at night.

00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:29,460
So where do you get EMFs from in your house?

00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:36,460
Well, you get EMFs that are produced locally through electronics,

00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:44,460
through number one source of EMF in your house produced locally is your Wi-Fi.

00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:47,460
That's the number one produced locally, EMF.

00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:52,460
But you also get EMFs from your cell phones if they're plugged in next to you all night long,

00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:58,460
because those are coming not locally from the cell phone, but from the cell phone tower,

00:00:58,460 --> 00:01:01,460
it's still connecting all night long.

00:01:01,460 --> 00:01:06,460
So you shouldn't leave your cell phone plugged in next to you in bed.

00:01:06,460 --> 00:01:20,460
So the other sources of locally produced EMFs are dirty EMFs, dirty electricity from your wiring of your house, everybody's house is hardwired.

00:01:20,460 --> 00:01:28,460
And the number one source of external EMFs that's coming from the outside of your house is a cell phone tower.

00:01:28,460 --> 00:01:34,460
And your outside meter, your electric meter.

00:01:34,460 --> 00:01:38,460
So getting your meter cover can be really helpful.

00:01:38,460 --> 00:01:47,460
You can't do anything about cell phone towers that are near you except moving away from one.

00:01:47,460 --> 00:01:51,460
Are you getting EMFs from the right machine from the generator itself?

00:01:51,460 --> 00:01:54,460
No, you're not getting any EMFs from the generator.

00:01:54,460 --> 00:01:57,460
Are you getting EMFs from the laptop?

00:01:57,460 --> 00:02:03,460
Yes, if you leave the laptop on, that's why we suggest you close the laptop.

00:02:03,460 --> 00:02:05,460
What do you need it to sleep?

00:02:05,460 --> 00:02:07,460
It's not producing any more EMFs.

00:02:07,460 --> 00:02:11,460
You can get an EMF reader because we've done that and measure it.

00:02:11,460 --> 00:02:12,460
It's not producing any.

00:02:12,460 --> 00:02:20,460
So no, you do not need to be concerned about EMFs in your bedroom from the right generator and the laptop.

00:02:20,460 --> 00:02:23,460
If you close the laptop at night.

00:02:23,460 --> 00:02:28,460
So again, number one source that EMFs in your house produce locally is your Wi-Fi.

00:02:28,460 --> 00:02:32,460
So it's the right thing to do, turn your Wi-Fi off at night.

00:02:32,460 --> 00:02:34,460
Dirty electricity.

00:02:34,460 --> 00:02:37,460
So think about getting a mitigator for dirty electricity.

00:02:37,460 --> 00:02:40,460
That is the things that we have in our store.

00:02:40,460 --> 00:02:44,460
And your meter on the outside of your house.

00:02:44,460 --> 00:02:53,460
Think about getting the cover guard for your meter, then a little mesh cover guard that goes over it and tightens down on your meter cover.

00:02:53,460 --> 00:02:55,460
We have that on ours.

00:02:55,460 --> 00:03:02,460
Both at the office and our house and all my staff has them at their house too.

